==============================================================================
This fork
==============================================================================

Modified by Kazuhiro Takahashi (2026), in the fork
https://github.com/KazuhiroTakahashiAQ/rvt-rs (branch rvt-viewer), on top
of upstream commit 120e2f9. The changes (see the fork's git history):

  * ElemTable: read renumbered element tables (either id field may be the
    ascending one); overflow-checked lengths on 32-bit (wasm32) targets.
  * BasicFileInfo: take the Revit release from the `Format:` line and the
    header's release string before any year-like number in the text.
  * Partitions: read a partition a page at a time from a `Read + Seek`
    source, keep only the project's own (unkeyed) segments, leave the loaded
    families' documents un-inflated, check each gzip member's CRC-32 once,
    and record partitions left unread by the size limits.
  * Element extraction: `extract_graphs_selected` reads selected records
    without walking every partition; the increment table is bounded by its
    stream length; parameter data objects are found among the listed ones;
    the element table, material names and type materials are cached, and
    `release_export_caches` drops export caches.

The fork remains licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, including
