The fork's changes were derived only from the rvt-rs source code and from
observing the bytes of Revit files. The fork author did not use, inspect,
or analyze RevitAPI.dll or any Autodesk program. Statements about
RevitAPI.dll or other Autodesk software in CLEANROOM.md, README.md and
docs/ describe the work of the upstream author, not of this fork.

